        {
          "type": "list",
          "bbox": [
            0.327,
            0.541,
            0.548,
            0.611
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "1 I'm sorry, but we can't come to your party next Saturday.\n2 I like this hotel room. You the mountains from the window.\n3 You are speaking very quietly. I \\_\\_\\_\\_ you.\n4 Have you seen my bag? I \\_\\_\\_\\_ it.\n5 Catherine got the job because she \\_\\_\\_\\_ five languages."
        },
        {
