            0.661,
            0.546,
            0.744
          ],
          "sub_type": "text",
          "content": "1 I was tired, but I couldn't sleep\n2 I wasn't hungry yesterday. I my dinner.\n3 Kate doesn't know what to do. She\n4 I wanted to speak to Mark yesterday, but I him.\nS James to the concert next Saturday. He has to work.\n6 Paula to the meeting last week. She was ill."
        },
        {
